      paragraphs: [
        "Inflation can occur for several different reasons, and economists often separate these causes into two main categories.",
        "The first is called demand-pull inflation, which happens when people want to buy more goods than businesses can supply. When demand exceeds supply, businesses raise prices, since customers are willing to pay more to get limited products.",
